selector:
matchLabels:
app: myapp
template:
metadata:
labels:
app: myapp
spec:
containers:
- name: myapp
image: myimage
ports:
- containerPort: 80
• Create a service:
Create a service in Kubernetes that exposes the deployment to the network.
Here's an example of a service YAML file:
apiVersion: v1
kind: Service
metadata:
name: myapp-service
spec:
selector:
app: myapp
ports:
- name: http
port: 80
targetPort: 80
